  "pretraining": "Contrastive learning with DINO framework, modality-specific patch embeddings, cross-attention fusion, and dual-centering for class-frequency-aware regularization. Pretrained on globally distributed Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 imagery using large tiles and land-cover aware sampling.",
